How to Simulate

Open ModelSim
Run the following commands:

tclvlib work
do compile.do
vsim TB_two_routers
add wave -recursive *
run 500 ns
Or simply run:
Bashvsim -do "do compile.do; run -all"
Files Description

two_routers.vhd → Top-level module connecting two routers
TB_two_routers.vhd → Testbench for the final design
Router.vhd → Main router component
my_fifo/ → Synchronous FIFO with valid data filtering

